# Task XMLs MUST stay UTF-16LE with BOM. `schtasks /query /xml` emits in this
# encoding and `schtasks /create /xml` rejects anything else as "malformed
# document syntax (1,2)". If an IDE or linter "fixes" the encoding to UTF-8
# the file will silently look fine in git diff but the restore script will
# fail every time. Treating them as binary stops git autocrlf line-ending
# mangling AND signals to editors not to re-encode on save.
*.xml binary
